            <div xml:id="d139">

                <pb facs="0295" n="207" sameAs="frus:frus1919Parisv02/pg207"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Paris Peace Conf. 863.50/37: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Commission to Negotiate Peace to the Acting
                        Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paris</hi>
                        </placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-23">December 23,
                            1918</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>64. [From Lansing.] Your number 96, December 21st, 10 p.m. I approve of the
                    proposed replies to French Embassy and Swiss <pb facs="0296" n="208"
                        xml:id="pg208"/> Legation. Suggest that you advise American Legation, Berne,
                    if you have not already done so. Lansing.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Am</hi>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">erican</hi>] <hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">Mission</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
